[[File:Terror dog icon.png|left]]
'''Terror dogs''' are [[Slayer monsters]] that require a [[Slayer]] level of 40 (not boostable) to kill. Being the personal pets of [[Tarn Razorlor]],{{CiteNPC|npc=Slayer Master|quote=Terror Dogs are the personal pets of Tarn Razorlor. Wherever you find him, you will find them. They are bad-tempered and generally unfriendly.|loc=|notes=|name=}} they are first encountered during the miniquest [[Lair of Tarn Razorlor]], in which the player must fight two terror dogs, alongside some [[Animated Armour|animated armour]] in addition to [[Tarn]] himself. Upon completion of the miniquest, more terror dogs can be found in the room.

Terror dogs use an accurate melee attack. As the room they are fought in is a multi-combat area, fighting them can become very dangerous quickly, as multiple terror dogs can attack the player all at once.

Terror dogs do not count toward fulfilling a Slayer task for dogs; they are a separate task. They are the only monsters that drop the [[Granite helm]]et.

Killing a Terror Dog is one of the tasks for the [[Morytania_Diary#Medium|Medium Morytania Diary]].

